<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ'S ASB BANK LIFTS JUNE YEAR PROFIT BY 29 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>NZ'S ASB BANK LIFTS JUNE YEAR PROFIT BY 29 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's ASB Bank Ltd on Wednesday reported a 29 percent increase in its June year net profit to NZ$92.5 million.</p>
</text>
